%% title: Steps of one admission round on the desk
%% desc: The desk walks a round through applications, fee checks, test steps with marks, a cut-off, the merit list, waiting lists and admission. A card at the top always says what to do now.
flowchart LR
  A["Applications<br/>fees checked"] --> T["Test step<br/>roll numbers, marks"]
  T --> K["Cut-off<br/>who goes on"]
  K --> M["Merit list"]
  M --> W["Waiting lists<br/>if seats are left"]
  M --> P["Admission"]:::done
  W --> P
  classDef done fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef stop fill:#fff5f5,stroke:#c92a2a,color:#5c1111
